  "body": "I think every Advertisement packet comes with an RSSI ([Android](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/le/ScanResult.html), [macOS](https://developer.apple.com/reference/corebluetooth/cbcentralmanagerdelegate/1518937-centralmanager?language=objc)). We should mark the rssi property as always present in [BluetoothAdvertisingEvent](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#bluetoothadvertisingevent)\n",
